@startuml snapshot-architecture
!include ../../sellStocks/diagrams/sell-style.puml
title Two ways to maintain a projection
caption Proposed designs — choose transaction semantics explicitly
start
:Apply portfolio operation;
if (Projection update strategy?) then (Synchronous)
  #E4F3EF:Write portfolio, history
and projection;
  :Commit the shared transaction;
  note right
    All participating writes precede
    the same commit.
  end note
else (Asynchronous)
  #E4F3EF:Write portfolio, history
and outbox event;
  :Commit the command transaction;
  #FFF3D9:Relay event after commit;
  :Consume with deduplication
and ordering/version checks;
  :Commit projection update;
  note right
    Report can lag the command.
    Delivery can be repeated.
  end note
endif
:Read projection with freshness metadata;
:Reconcile or rebuild using
a consistent version/cutoff;
stop
@enduml
